spec PushAppleAuthorization.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK ExclusiveSigner PersistentIdentity DurableAcrossRestart MinimumRefreshGap RefreshDecisions ReturnedAfterCommit HeaderLifetime UsesSharedHeader
check PROPERTIES RequestFinishes
reach BothRefreshWait | cold
reach SameHeader | cold
reach FreshBeforeBoundary | warm
reach RefreshAtBoundary | warm
reach WarmRefreshCompetition | warm
reach ReuseAcrossRestart | cold
reach FailedWhileCold | cold
run cold two devices | Clients={1,2} EndHour=3 Warm=FALSE
run warm two devices | Clients={1,2} EndHour=3 Warm=TRUE
